WEBVTT

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:05.520
Joshua, don't get in my way!

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:21.490
I'll take care of him, Aion.
You take the Holy Woman and go.

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:23.910
Use it.

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:46.640
It's all right. I'll stop his rampage.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.850
Joshua...

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:58.860
Rosette!

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:14.920
Stop it, Joshua!
Aion's the one you need to kill!

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:21.180
Stop it!

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:27.680
Joshua!

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:34.110
Joshua! Come to your senses!

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:36.020
Josh...

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:58.500
Shall we go?

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:01.800
No, let go of me!

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:06.260
Rosette!

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:08.390
Silence.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:21.530
Yay! Get him, Genai!

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:50.430
Ow!

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:53.350
Now you've done it!

00:04:56.650 --> 00:05:01.360
How clumsy. Is this the power of Heaven?

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:07.450
Late as always.
Mary Who Brings the Light is right here.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:12.240
Stop it, Aion. Don't destroy
the balance between Heaven and Earth!

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:14.660
Then why do the Apostles exist?

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.210
Rosette Christopher...

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:24.970
...the holy scars carved
into you belong to me.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:29.220
Now Heaven has no choice
but to recognize who I am.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:40.060
Chrono...

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:41.400
Joshua...

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.280
Please! Stop it!

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:56.160
Rosette!

00:05:58.250 --> 00:05:59.750
Chrono...

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.460
Rosette!

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:09.260
Joshua...

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:17.890
Chrono...

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:28.860
Joshua, stop it.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:45.800
Stop it!

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:50.260
The noise is... the noise is...

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:52.550
Please stop!

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:58.270
Lord Joshua...

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:07.570
Older sister?

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:17.540
Lord Joshua...

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:20.210
No! Stop it, older sister!

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:27.340
The noise... Stop the noise!

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:43.480
Rosette...

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:48.110
You must live...

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:51.700
Chrono!

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:04.080
Lord Joshua...

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:12.630
Older sister...

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:30.820
Aion!

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:33.200
Are you still trying to interfere?!

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:37.030
Bastard!

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:57.850
Damned angel...

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.940
Azmaria! Remington!

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.400
Are you both all right?

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:10.860
Yes, but...

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:14.240
Rosette...

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:28.210
I wasn't strong enough, Sister Kate.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:31.960
Unfortunately, Aion got away with Rosette.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:35.550
We were able to rescue Joshua,

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:40.180
but even that is only because he is
no longer of any use to the Sinners.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.220
It is our failure.

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:49.810
There is one thing
that I simply must ask you.

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:52.070
About me, yes?

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:59.030
You know how far it is from
New York to San Francisco, I take it.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:01.200
When did you get there?

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:04.660
I also possess the name of an angel.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:11.790
All the same, I was quite powerless.

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:53.250
Sister Claire...

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:55.800
It would be best
for you to sleep some more.

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:57.300
Thank you.

00:10:58.670 --> 00:10:59.930
Azmaria?

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:02.340
Where is Minister Remington?

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:06.430
Probably upstairs with Minister Gilliam.

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:08.640
Please take me to him!

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:12.940
I have something I need
to talk to him about, right now!

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.940
I understand.

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:31.370
The head of Pandemonium sent
something like a memory into my mind.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:34.290
That when the devils
were driven out of Heaven,

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:37.960
they made a pact with God.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:41.510
Man, who possessed knowledge,
would some day fall from grace.

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:45.930
That is why the devils were given the role
of making man fear Heaven once again,

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:51.640
in order to guide man away
from corruption and to salvation.

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:56.610
It appears that is what
that atonement ceremony was.

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:06.580
We, the Apostles,
symbolize the seven virtues

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:09.950
in order to teach man
the strength of Heaven's authority.

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:15.790
To Heaven,
the devils are indispensable entities.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:19.710
It is because the devils
exist that man worships God.

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:24.260
At that time, during the chaos,

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:27.100
a savior that will lead
the people to salvation will appear.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:30.770
That message is what
Rosette's stigmata were, right?

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:33.270
No, it's a deterrent.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:34.520
A deterrent?

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:40.070
It's true that the atonement ritual
might be to call forth reverence for God.

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:45.070
But at the same time, it is also when

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:49.740
a devil can further taint
a person's heart with darkness.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:52.410
The stigmata that
young woman had carved into her

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:57.170
and this unique justice should
have been a powerful deterrent

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:59.920
to a devil rising to power.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:04.630
So that in the end, Heaven will
be able to sing the praises of victory.

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:07.890
I see, so paradoxically,

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:11.770
that powerful deterrent is
also a powerful military force.

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:15.640
And this is why Aion wanted Rosette.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:18.480
At times, justice is
accompanied by violence.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:21.730
He wanted to use the justice as violence.

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:27.450
Is that the other ending to
the Apocalypse that he was talking about?

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:32.950
An army of angels...
How much did you know?

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:36.330
I don't have any power.
Rather, I mustn't do anything.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:39.580
All I can do is watch over the times.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:43.340
As I think about it now,

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:50.800
the Sinners gathering
the Apostles together

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:54.390
might itself have been Heaven's plan.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:57.100
So, what do we do from here?

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:58.560
Nothing.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:01.480
We keep going, just as we have.

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:20.460
Is this also because of my causality?

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:26.340
My wings call forth unhappiness.

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:31.340
Not a single person that has
been a part of my life will be happy.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:42.730
Chrono, save Rosette.

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:07.520
An empty vessel...

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:18.740
Put it on.

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:19.910
No...

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:23.580
Fiore made this for you.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:27.090
The Jewel Witch's older sister.

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:31.670
For when Joshua
met his real older sister.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:33.300
Where's Joshua?

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:36.890
Your friends took him away.

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:39.600
I have no business with
the Apostles any longer.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:42.600
I don't need the other Sinners either.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:45.440
Right now, it's just you and me.

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:47.270
Why?

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:50.280
How about seeing with your own eyes?

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:04.500
That was too selfless for a devil.

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:16.260
This is the answer?

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.550
This is all your doing.

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:22.890
This was done by your beloved younger
brother and your partner. It was all over you.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:26.230
This is the result of your four years.

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:28.480
Because of the love they have for you.

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:33.900
Because of love,
Chrono and Joshua destroyed the town.

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:40.580
This is the proof of their love for you.

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:44.620
It's cruel proof,
isn't it, Rosette Christopher?

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:47.790
Because of you,
so many people have died,

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:51.590
been hurt, and lost their future.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:56.130
Everyone is wondering,
"Why did this happened to me?"

00:17:56.130 --> 00:18:01.470
"God, why are you
doing this? Please tell me."

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:05.390
Everyone is clutching their
crucifixes and looking up at Heaven.

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:08.690
But He will never answer them.

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:11.940
Many people have died.

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:15.820
In an instant, those things most
precious to them were taken away.

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:20.490
Have they committed any
kind of sin? This is too irrational.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:24.120
You can hear their
sorrowful voices, can't you?

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:28.620
As He shows you this
despair and hopelessness,

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:31.500
where is the hand to save them?

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:35.380
It's the same as four years ago.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:38.720
I can see your heart.
"I have to help them somehow, quickly."

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:40.090
That's it, right?

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:42.720
That is faith, and the path of man.

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:45.310
That is something you are able to do.

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:47.560
What could you possibly know?

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:50.650
I do know, because I'm a devil.

00:18:54.690 --> 00:19:00.740
Forget about that unmoving watch.
You're an accomplice now.

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:05.370
Make your choice.
Do you want to save them, or don't you?

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:07.120
I want to save them.

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.620
But not with you!

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:19.340
You're going to start it. We'll change
the world together, and build the era.

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:21.430
Ever since I first laid eyes on you,

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:24.890
I waited for the justice that
was inside of you to mature.

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:32.190
Justice swelled up in
the space between faith and revenge.

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:36.980
And so much killing happened
in the name of love, because of you.

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:38.860
That is what you are.

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:44.820
This town was sacrificed
in order for us to win our freedom.

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:47.700
Are you prepared to
fly into freedom with me?

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:52.120
Chrono told you to live.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:55.090
What is it that you must live to achieve?

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:57.590
What purpose...

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:59.460
...are these marks for?

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:47.430
Do you still need that?

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:51.350
This is my life.
